<accent red>**CAUTION: Access to principal of the SORT may preclude a Surviving Spouse from Medicaid qualification, but restricting the access to principal may accelerate income taxes due as required minimum distributions from the qualified plan naming the SORT as a beneficiary may not be stretched over the measuring life of the Surviving Spouse as the Surviving Spouse will not be considered the "see through" beneficiary without unfettered access to principal of the SORT.**</accent>   
